# The Black Arrow: its enters trigger deals 1 damage to Bot2's Ornithopter, a 0/2 Thopter that is no Dragon, so nothing is destroyed and
# the Ornithopter simply carries 1 damage (CR 120.3, 704.5g).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
The Black Arrow
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.End]
